[00:00.57]1. Jehovah knows just what we need
[00:12.67]To bring us joy and to succeed.
[00:22.36]So he provides so many ways
[00:29.50]In which to serve and spend our days.
[00:36.64](Chorus)
[00:42.70]Reaching out, giving all,
[00:48.76]for our God above.
[00:59.76]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[01:07.46]reaching out in love.
[01:15.16]2. There’s work to do in ev’ry land.
[01:21.16]Where there’s a need, we lend a hand.
[01:27.16]By reaching out, we show we care.
[01:33.16]We want to help and want to share.
[01:41.56](Chorus)
[01:44.90]Reaching out, giving all,
[01:48.23]for our God above.
[01:51.56]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[02:10.74]reaching out in love.
[02:29.92]3. And here at home, in towns nearby,
[02:39.53]We plan, we build, new skills we try.
[02:42.53]We learn to speak a foreign tongue
[02:45.53]And bring good news to ev’ryone.
[02:48.53](Chorus)
[02:51.53]Reaching out, giving all,
[03:01.48]for our God above.
[03:11.43]And where the need is great, there we’ll be,
[03:21.38]reaching out in love.